OL,3,GNEWSAInvestigation after woman found
OL,4,Adead in city flat
OL,5,
OL,6,FDetectives are investigating the
OL,7,F"unexplained" death of a woman at a
OL,8,Fflat in Bradford.
OL,10,FWest Yorkshire Police said they went to
OL,11,Fan address at Holmfield Court in the
OL,12,Fcity at about 13:30 BST on Sunday after
OL,13,Fa welfare check had been requested.
OL,15,FOfficers entered the property and found
OL,16,Fa woman inside. She was pronounced dead
OL,17,Fat the scene.
OL,19,FA spokesperson for the force said: "A
OL,20,Fscene remains in place while enquiries
OL,21,Fcontinue into her death, which at this
OL,22,Ftime is being treated as unexplained."
